      "id": "ce93db1e-b4ac-40fc-ace8-9f0f28f4e65b",
      "name": "Watermarks (Folders)",
      "description": {
        "content": "A watermark is a semi-transparent overlay on an embedded folder\npreview that displays a viewer's email address or user ID\nand the time of access over\nthe folder content.",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
      "item": [
        {
